return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);','language'=>'am','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-25T15:09:48+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-25T15:09:48+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','The foundation release of the rebuilt Tranzly: a list of your site\'s languages, a language switcher block, and the language API other plugins read.'=>'የታደሰው Tranzly የመጀመሪያ ስሪት፡ የጣቢያዎ ቋንቋዎች ዝርዝር፣ የቋንቋ መቀየሪያ ብሎክ፣ እና ሌሎች ተሰኪዎች የሚያነቡት የቋንቋ API።','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'ይቅርታ፣ ይህንን ገጽ እንዲደርሱበት አልተፈቀደልዎም።','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'የአስተዳዳሪው ስክሪን ስክሪፕቶች ከዚህ ተሰኪ (ፕለጊን) ቅጂ ጠፍተዋል። ከተለቀቀ ጥቅል እንደገና ይጫኑት።','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'ይህ ማያ ገጽ ጃቫ ስክሪፕት (JavaScript) ይፈልጋል።','Choose a language'=>'ቋንቋ ይምረጡ','Upgrade'=>'አሻሽል','Pricing'=>'ዋጋዎች','Start Trial'=>'ሙከራ ጀምር','Account'=>'መለያ','Contact Us'=>'ያግኙን','Affiliation'=>'ተባባሪነት','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'ፕለጊን','greetingHey %s,'=>'ሰላም %s፣','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'የደህንነት እና የባህሪ ማሻሻያዎችን፣ የትምህርት ይዘቶችን እና መደበኛ ያልሆኑ ቅናሾችን በተመለከተ የኢሜይል ማሳወቂያዎችን ለማግኘት እና አንዳንድ መሰረታዊ የ WordPress አካባቢ መረጃዎችን ለማጋራት ይመዝገቡ። ይህ %s ከእርስዎ ድር ጣቢያ ጋር የበለጠ ተኳሃኝ እንዲሆን እና የሚፈልጉትን ለማድረግ የተሻለ እንዲሆን ይረዳናል።','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'ለደህንነት እና ለባሪ ባ